":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3f4-200d-2620-fe0f","type":"pirates","dx":51,"x":974.12,"y":185.88,"cell":797,"i":100,"name":"Pirates","tags":[],"note":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1327.51,"y":1517.27,"cell":14212,"i":101,"name":"Pzk'ol Sculpture","tags":[],"note":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc1d\ud802𐠌𐠭𐠯\udc1e\udc18\udc27\udc19𐠌\udc31\udc2f\ud802𐠁𐠮\udc01\ud802𐠸\udc23\udc12𐠜\udc3c\udc13\ud802\ud802𐠋\udc20\ud802𐠑\udc3c\udc2d\udc26\ud802 \udc37\udc2b\ud802\ud802𐠘𐠱\udc18\ud802𐠅\ud802\ud802\ud802</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1335.62,"y":1327.89,"cell":12201,"i":102,"name":"Edaklig Effigy","tags":[],"note":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">⳧ⲺⲸⳘⳬⲶⳐⲶ ⲲⳬⳜⳁ⳾⳧ⳂⳁⳎⳌⳫⲶⳲⲲⲲⳬⳜ Ⳇ⳪ⳁⲸⳊ⳹ⲺⳠⳜⳄⳢⳆⳭⲴ⳩Ⲵ⳩ⲺⳎ⳾ⳃⳈⳲ⳧ⳂⲼⲸⲴ Ⳕ ⳫⳄⳠⳬⳜⳭⳈⳃⳆⲺⳌⳐⲶⳎⳊⳂ⳪⳪ⳞⳲⳢⳒⳜ ⳬ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1845.61,"y":540.39,"cell":4496,"i":103,"name":"Stagbutumn Megalith","tags":[],"note":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ጸ ጸሰሀጸ ለጠደጰሠጰጰጸተተ ዐረዐመመሀየፀዐሠጰ ሠፐዘጰየነለፀመበዘኀወበጠኀገደደአመኀለበፐዘጰፀረነጠሀተለዐፐበገደደጸ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":752.87,"y":492.86,"cell":3840,"i":104,"name":"Nar'jess Sculpture","tags":[],"note":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༕༆༙༱༢༉༾༻༬༿༇༊༗༅༑༔༌༈༣༩༼༰༂༠༆༸༣༠༽༼༉༻༛༭༗༂་༱༖༒༺༡༺༯༕༖༦༫༗༉༡༾༆ༀ༠༅༫༯༦༉༉༢༬༃ༀ༭༿༽༿་༯༘༷༄༽༴༽༠༬༅༢༰༹༳༔༮</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1633.13,"y":1531.21,"cell":14374,"i":105,"name":"Tracrag Obelisk","tags":[],"note":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༤༾༔༛༅༅༔༹༕༴༦༺༙༳༩༼༻་༡༹༊༫༾༽༧༴༃༳༩༧༠༧༦༘༙༨༔༷༌༵༡༙༭༶༷༪༹༵༅༻༢༺༌༺༯༜༧་༕ༀ༂༬༨༹༇༲༈༯༾༈༼༩༃༷༂༂༇༽༴༴༩༽༘༶༔༷༅༵༣༤༰༖༴༥</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1438.33,"y":1495.6,"cell":13948,"i":106,"name":"Fha'tor'zul Monolith","tags":[],"note":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳖⲲⳭ ⳎⳖⳀⲺⲺ Ⲳⳃⳃ⳥Ⲿ⳧⳥ⳁⳢⳀⳔ ⲲⳠⳄⳤⳘⳞⳌⲲⳎⳘⲸⳞⲴⳌ  ⳹ⲸⳂⳚⳜⳖⳢⳔⳁⲶ⳪⳥ⳐⲾⳢⳖⳫⳎⳐⳄ Ⳟⳬⳃ⳩Ⳋ⳪Ⲽ ⳂⳄⳠⲶⳁ⳪Ⳳ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":568.2,"y":892.54,"cell":8107,"i":107,"name":"Varkush Sculpture","tags":[],"note":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༭༧༂༃༥༾༮༴༬༮༽༵༨༹༕༾༯༊༾༤༵༭༕༷༿༜༓༩ༀ༃༡༳༨༄༘༁༇༓༗༲༰༂༾༬་༚༄༂༺༳༿༵༑༃༉༅༔༐༴༒༼༾༑༖</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1218.4,"y":627.74,"cell":5336,"i":108,"name":"Shugashjuk Obelisk","tags":[],"note":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc2d\udc3f\ud802𐠞\ud802𐠓\udc14\udc1f\udc16\udc12\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802 \udc35\udc1d\udc31\udc38\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠞\ud802\ud802\ud802 \udc29\udc14\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠛 \udc38\ud802𐠗𐠊\udc26\udc02\udc20\udc29𐠗\udc1b\udc08\ud802\ud802𐠚\ud802𐠑\ud802𐠳\udc29\udc3c\udc23\udc0b𐠓𐠳\udc1f𐠮𐠛𐠗\ud802𐠭\udc0c\udc22\udc26\ud802𐠁\ud802\ud802𐠣 \udc08\udc0b\udc11\udc20</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1107.19,"y":1568.19,"cell":14592,"i":109,"name":"Paaszils Megalith","tags":[],"note":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\ud802𐠣\ud802𐠛\udc0b\ud802𐠍\udc2a𐠅𐠤𐠁\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠧\udc28\ud802𐠐\udc31\udc1f\ud802\ud802𐠋\udc08\udc0f𐠟\udc2c\ud802 𐠖\ud802\ud802𐠅\udc32\udc26\udc23\ud802</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":761.73,"y":1727.08,"cell":15852,"i":110,"name":"Celkeh Runestone","tags":[],"note":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༷༛༛༈༴༤༡༕༧༻་༕༲༗༹༨༵༕༲༊༪༤༼༂༚༛༪༜༌༈༓༌༛༣༤༈༓༪ༀ༦༮༂༈༹༅༸༇༯༐༁༜༬༳༠༰༹༒༊༭</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f4da","type":"libraries","x":1483.42,"y":1858.84,"cell":16664,"i":111,"name":"Horncrest Collection","tags":[],"note":"A vast collection of knowledge, including many rare and ancient tomes."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3aa","type":"circuses","x":406.26,"y":1606.92,"cell":14908,"i":112,"name":"Travelling World-famous Circus","tags":[],"note":"Roll up, roll up, this world-famous circus is here for a limited time only."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3aa","type":"circuses","x":1404.68,"y":1843.95,"cell":16590,"i":113,"name":"Travelling Fantastical Circus","tags":[],"note":"Roll up, roll up, this fantastical circus is here for a limited time only."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3aa","type":"circuses","x":393.2,"y":244.1,"cell":1174,"i":114,"name":"Travelling Breathtaking Circus","tags":[],"note":"Roll up, roll up, this breathtaking circus is here for a limited time only."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3aa","type":"circuses","x":1427.03,"y":1378.7,"cell":12802,"i":115,"name":"Travelling Extraordinary Circus","tags":[],"note":"Roll up, roll up, this extraordinary circus is here for a limited time only."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3aa","type":"circuses","x":1319.28,"y":807.35,"cell":7268,"i":116,"name":"Travelling Breathtaking Circus","tags":[],"note":"Roll up, roll up, this breathtaking circus is here for a limited time only."},{"icon":"glyph-1f93a","type":"jousts","dx":48,"x":1573.62,"y":1416.5,"cell":13234,"i":117,"name":"J'gath Tournament","tags":[],"note":"Warriors from around the land gather for a tournament of cunning in J'gath, with fame, fortune and favour on offer to the victor."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3a0","type":"fairs","x":1799.64,"y":429.75,"cell":3340,"i":118,"name":"Avorum Fair","tags":[],"note":"A fair is being held in Avorum, offering local coal alongside foreign goods 